,
  "notes":
["The source set has 17 ordinary faces, one boxed Handicap and one Ultimate (19 fronts). Original reader note said 18 ordinary in error; actual table covers17 plus an ordinary-card Ultimate probe.","Throw the Gauntlet asks the target hero whether to move 1 space. The source-format's hero-owned answers support a decline; this case records that choice and the placement outcome.","Feat of Bravery and Paragon of Valor retrieve a discarded card for another friendly hero. The cases stage Min and use the printed Crane Stance card as that hero's only discard; the format defaults the friendly hero's optional retrieval to confirmation.","The ultimate is a permanent ability applied while Rowenna is on the board, not a separately chosen action; the case exercises the extended range with her Gold basic Attack at level 8.","The repeated Opening Volley scenario uses a second eligible enemy hero because the first hero has a discard after the first repetition and no longer meets the printed condition."]
}
